## Done criteria, with the commands and their outputs

### Done 1 — "`ConvertProperty` round-trips the built `.epe` to identical XML"

**Not run on a built file: there is no built `.epe` this card produced.** Run on the base the card
would edit (`Builds/bm-009/aaf/…/v0300_car_kensington_sportsmuscle_civilian_01.epe`), the mechanism
is proven end to end:

```
